            {
              "id": "1774029195823_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "If the semantic question includes a “Resolved SR” condition, output: status.lookupCode IN ('ORA_SVC_RESOLVED','ORA_SVC_CLOSED')\n\notherwise, if no SR status is mentioned, output an empty string."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"filter\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract SR Info",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const data = $context.$nodes.GET_SR_BY_QUERY.$output.items \nconst result = data.map(item => ({\n  SrNumber: item.SrNumber,\n  Title: item.Title,\n  ProblemDescription: item.ProblemDescription,\n  ResolveDescription: item.ResolveDescription\n}));\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766015983868"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_SR_INFO",
          "id": "1774323226169",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolver Related"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772562762939"
          },
          "code": "RESOLVER_RELATED",
          "id": "1774390341422",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774390341425_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nIf the input message is not related to assignees, output \"N\". Example: “Show me recently resolved SRs similar to SR0000084645” → \"N\"\n\nIf the input message is about the count of SRs (\"Service Requests\") resolved by assignees (such as “Who has resolved the most SRs similar to SR# XYZ?”): output \"Y\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Build Assignee Query",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const currentAssignee = $context.$nodes.GET_SR_BY_QUERY.$output.items[0]?.AssigneePersonName;\nconst data = $context.$nodes.GET_SIMILAR_SR_DETAILS.$output.items\n\nconst names = data\n  .map(item => item.ResolvedBy)\n  .filter(name => name);\n\nif (currentAssignee) {\n  names.push(currentAssignee);\n}\n\n// Remove duplicates\nconst uniqueNames = [...new Set(names)];\n\n// Build query\nconst assigneePersonNameQuery = uniqueNames\n  .map(name => `AssigneePersonName like '%${name}%'`)\n  .join(' OR ');\n\nconst finalQuery = `(${assigneePersonNameQuery}) AND StatusTypeCd != 'ORA_SVC_RESOLVED' AND StatusTypeCd != 'ORA_SVC_CLOSED'`;\n\nreturn finalQuery;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772562825440"
          },
          "code": "BUILD_ASSIGNEE_QUERY",
          "id": "1774391623362",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Rank Similar SR Details By Score",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const data1 = $context.$nodes.SERVICE_REQUEST_KEYWORDS_SEARCH.$output.items;\nconst data2 = $context.$nodes.GET_SIMILAR_SR_DETAILS.$output.items;\n\n// Step 1: Build lookup map\nconst vectorScoreMap = {};\ndata1.forEach(item => {\n  if (item.number && item.$context?.search?.vectorScore !== undefined) {\n    vectorScoreMap[item.number] = item.$context.search.vectorScore;\n  }\n});\n\n// Step 2: Merge + remove @context\nconst mergedData = data2.map(item => {\n  const { ['@context']: _, ...rest } = item; // remove @context\n  const srNumber = rest.SrNumber;\n\n  return {\n    ...rest,\n    vectorScore: vectorScoreMap[srNumber] ?? null\n  };\n});\n\n// Step 3: Sort by vectorScore (descending, nulls last)\nmergedData.sort((a, b) => {\n  if (a.vectorScore === null) return 1;\n  if (b.vectorScore === null) return -1;\n  return b.vectorScore - a.vectorScore;\n});\n\nreturn mergedData;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774390341422"
          },
          "code": "RANK_SIMILAR_SR_DETAILS_BY_SCORE",
          "id": "1774564343728",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Stalled SR Answer Bot"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "STALLED_SR_ANSWER_BOT",
          "id": "1774567181662",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774567181663_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the question {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}, provide a concise and structured answer based on the user’s intent.\n\nHandle the following scenarios:\n\n- Total stalled SRs (team-level)\nData: {{$context.$nodes.STALLED_SR_OVERVIEW.$output.result}}\nFirst, generate a response that includes the number of stalled SRs, along with a breakdown by severity and status.\nSecond, generate an <oraInsight> button at the end\n{\n  \"title\": \"Show stalled SRs in <status> status\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<comma-separated SR numbers from dataset>\"}) \"\n}\n\n- Stalled SRs by status\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_STATUS.$output.result}} \nFirst, generate a response that includes the total number of stalled SRs for the specified status, along with a breakdown by severity.\nSecond, generate an <oraInsight> button at the end\n}\n  \"title\": \"Show stalled SRs in <status> severity\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<comma-separated SR numbers from dataset>\"}) \"\n}\n\n- Stalled SRs by severity\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_SEVERITY.$output.result}} \nFirst, generate a response that includes the total number of stalled SRs for the specified severity, along with a breakdown by status.\nSecond, generate an <oraInsight> button at the end\n}\n  \"title\": \"Show stalled SRs in <severity> severity\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<comma-separated SR numbers from dataset>\"}) \"\n}\n\n- Reopened stalled SRs\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_REOPENS.$output.result}} \nFirst, generate a response that includes the number of stalled SRs that have been reopened, with a breakdown by severity.\nSecond, generate an <oraInsight> button at the end\n{\n  \"title\": \"Show reopened stalled SRs.\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<comma-separated SR numbers from dataset>\"}) \"\n}\n\n\n- Top products with stalled SRs\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_PRODUCT.$output.result}} \nBased on {{$context.$nodes.STALLED_SRS_GROUP_BY_PRODUCT.$output.result}}. Return the top 3 products ranked by number of stalled SRs, including counts by severity.\nGenerate an action button at the end of each row. \n\"action\": {\n  \"text\": \"Review\",\n  \"command\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<SR numbers associated with this product, separated by commas>\"})\"\n}\n\n\n- Queues with most stalled SRs\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_QUEUE.$output.result}} \nReturn queues ranked by number of stalled SRs, with a breakdown by severity.\nGenerate an action button at the end of each row. \n\"action\": {\n  \"text\": \"Review\",\n  \"command\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<SR numbers associated with this queue, separated by commas>\"})\"\n}\n\n\n- Agents with most stalled SRs\nData: {{$context.$nodes.SRS_GROUPED_BY_ASSIGNEE.$output.result}} \nReturn agents ranked by number of stalled SRs assigned to them, with a breakdown by severity.\nGenerate an action button at the end of each row. \n\"action\": {\n  \"text\": \"Review\",\n  \"command\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"reviewStalledSRs\",\"srNumbers\":\"<SR numbers associated with this agent, separated by commas>\"})\"\n}\n\nEnsure the response is concise, directly answers the question, and only includes the relevant scenario based on the user’s query. If no data is available, be honest and say that no data is available. Do not make up, infer, or fabricate any information. Return only what is supported by the provided data."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SERVICECEN_SERVICEREQUESTS11131805",
            "functionName": "getSRsByQueryWithFields",
            "name": "Get Stalled SR Details"
