              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Current SR Problem Description:\n{{$context.$nodes.CURRENT_SR_INFO.$output.result}}\n\nSimilar Resolved SR Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_RESOLVED_SR_DETAILS.$output}}\n\nInstructions:\nFrom the resolved SR data, list the following in bullet points:\n\nTitle\nProblem Description\nResolve Date\nResolution Description\nResolved By\n\nAfter listing the resolved SRs, provide a concise summary explaining how these past resolutions can help address the current SR problem."
