          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772583208306_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert support assistant. You will be provided with Service Request (SR) details and a user question.\n\nQuestion: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nSR details: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SR_BY_QUERY.$output}}\nSR messages: {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_UP_SR_MESSAGES.$output.result}} \n\nInstructions:\n\nProvide a chronological description of the SR history, focusing only on key milestones rather than every individual update.\n\nInclude only significant events that meaningfully advanced troubleshooting, clarified the issue, reflected customer sentiment, or impacted the resolution.\n\nFocus only on customer entries, support responses, and internal messages. Do not include AI system notes or any automated/system-generated entries.\n\nInclude:\n\nCustomer updates or requests with important technical details, urgency, or frustration.\n\nInternal notes summarizing major troubleshooting steps, diagnostic findings, escalation decisions, or corrective actions.\n\nDisplay updates in chronological order.\n\nKeep the summary concise, well-structured, and under 100 words.\n\nFirst, generate a message list widget containing the summarized key events. BadgeText should be a concise summary of the event (no more than 5 words), for example: “Agent Responded” or “Customer Angry.” Priority should be based on customer sentiment, with more angry customers receiving higher priority.\nSecond, generate an action button\n{\n  \"title\": \"See full message history\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"showFullMessageHistoy\",\"messageHisotry\":\"<SR messages>\"}) \"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
