          "id": "1775500038418",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775500038419_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert support assistant. You will be provided with Service Request (SR) details and a user question.\n\nQuestion: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nSR messages: {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_UP_SR_MESSAGES.$output.result}} \n\nGenerate a message list widget that displays each message’s original content, creation date, and message type. The widget should present the original message content exactly as it was provided, without summarizing or altering it. You should not display plain HTML; instead, render the content in a formatted, user-friendly way while preserving the meaning and structure of the original markup.\n\n{\n        \"title\": \"<Subject>\",\n        \"subtitle\":\"<MessageTypeCd (use natural language instead of code, such as \"Customer Entry\" or \"Response,\" and remove \"ORA_SVC\").>\"\n        \"summary\": \"<MessageContent>\",\n        \"status\": \"Investigating root cause\",\n        \"badgeText\": \"<A concise summary of the event (no more than 5 words), for example: “Agent Responded” or “Customer Angry.” >\",\n        \"priority\": \"<Based on customer sentiment, with more angry customers receiving higher priority.>\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"<CreationDate>\",\n}\n\nDisplay messages in reverse chronological order, with the newest messages at the top."
            }
