              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on {{$context.$nodes.FIND_ALTERNATIVES.$output.output}}:\n\n1. Generate a table using the following column structure:\n\n\"cols\": [\"Name\", \"Number of Currently Assigned SRs\", \"Competence Rating\"]\n\nPopulate the rows using the provided data.\n\nRules:\n- Do not add or remove columns.\n- Use only the information explicitly provided. Do not infer or generate missing values.\n\n2. Add an action button at the end each row\n\"action\": {\n  \"text\": \"<Action>\",\n  \"command\": \"ora.Invoke(\"askOracleAction\",{\"action\": \"<Action>\",\"agentPartyId\":\"<AgentPartyId>\",\"srNumber\":\"<SrNumber>\",\"agentName\":\"<AgentName>\"})\"\n}\n\n3. Provide a separate text section explaining why the agent is recommended.\n\nUse only the information explicitly provided in the data. Do not infer, assume, or generate any missing values."
            }
