              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "First, generate this exact text and nothing else in the message body: \"I don’t have enough information to answer that accurately.\"\n\nSecond, generate an action button with exactly this payload:\n{\n  \"title\": \"What can I ask?\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"action\": \"askGuidance\"})\"\n}"
            }
          ],
