        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Return Ask Guidance 2"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "RETURN_ASK_GUIDANCE_2",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1775071422588",
          "id": "1776704239267",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776704239268_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "<div style=\"line-height:1.1; font-size:14px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold;\">What can you ask?</p>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">1. Open Service Requests</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask about open SRs for a specific assignee or customer.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>How many open SRs are assigned to Lisa?</li>\n    <li>Show me all open SRs for GlobalCare Medical Center.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">2. SR Summaries and Message History</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask for a summary of what has happened on a specific SR so far.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>Give me a summary of SR0000078303.</li>\n    <li>Show me the full message history of SR0000088376.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">3. Similar or Historical SR Analysis</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask about past similar SRs, trends, or how related cases were resolved.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>Show me recently resolved SRs similar to SR0000078303.</li>\n    <li>Who has resolved the most SRs similar to SR0000078303?</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">4. Reassignment Alternatives</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask to see other agents who may be qualified to take over an SR.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>Show alternatives for reassigning SR0000078303.</li>\n    <li>Who else is qualified for SR0000078303?</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">5. Stalled Service Requests</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask about SRs that have had no recent progress or updates.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>How many stalled SRs are assigned to my team?</li>\n    <li>How many stalled SRs are currently in progress?</li>\n    <li>How many high severity SRs are stalled?</li>\n    <li>Which product has the most stalled SRs?</li>\n    <li>Which queues currently have the most stalled SRs?</li>\n    <li>Which agents have the most stalled SRs assigned?</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">6. Staffing Actions</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask to reassign an SR or add a team member to an SR.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 3px 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>Reassign SR0000078303 to John Smith.</li>\n    <li>Add Alice to SR0000078303.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">7. Ask Guidance</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;\">Ask what kinds of questions are supported. If you ask this, this instruction will be shown.</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0 0 0 16px; padding:0;\">\n    <li>What can I ask?</li>\n    <li>Show me example questions.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
